  "attribution_finding": {
    "classification": "Existing baseline BytePool observability defect fixed in candidate",
    "cause": "IndependentCPUOffloadingSpec constructs BytePoolOffloadingManager. Baseline BytePool implements lookup but inherits OffloadingManager.get_load_source, which returns EXTERNAL_UNSPECIFIED. The offloading scheduler asks that method for each loaded range. The logger eagerly creates every source label, so a present zero HOST counter does not demonstrate that no RAM was used. Candidate BytePool overrides get_load_source to return HOST.",
